## Grund citation rendering

In repositories with a `grund.toml` (at the root or under `.agents/`): follow each citation with its declaration location as plain `path:line` text in local conversations; fall back to the bare citation when unsure. Elsewhere, ignore this.
<!-- <<< grund integrations citation rendering (v4) <<< -->

